  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lower Limpopo River Valley Flood Reconstruction and Climate Resilience Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide emergency infrastructure repairs to restore connectivity to 500,000 people in the Limpopo Valley in the short-term (&#x201c;build back&#x201d;) whilst building capacity within the Government through enhanced early warning systems to improve climate-resilient planning (&#x201c;build back better&#x201d;)</narrative>
  </description>
